### ============================================
### POLICY ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/policies
### All endpoints are PUBLIC (no authentication required)
### Supports English (en) and Russian (ru) languages

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:29000
@policyPath = /api/v1/users/policies

### ============================================
### GET AVAILABLE POLICY LANGUAGES
### ============================================

### Get list of available policy language codes
GET {{baseUrl}}{{policyPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### GET POLICY BY LANGUAGE
### ============================================

### Get policy for English
GET {{baseUrl}}{{policyPath}}/en
Content-Type: application/json

### Get policy for Russian
GET {{baseUrl}}{{policyPath}}/ru
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### GET ALL POLICIES
### ============================================

### Get all policy translations (all supported languages)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{policyPath}}/all
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### TESTING INVALID LANGUAGE
### ============================================

### Test with unsupported language (should return error)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{policyPath}}/fr
Content-Type: application/json





